{"task_id": "Mbpp/256", "solution": "def count_Primes_nums(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of prime numbers strictly less than the given non-negative integer.\n    Implements the Sieve of Eratosthenes algorithm.\n    \"\"\"\n    if num <= 2:\n        return 0\n\n    sieve = [True] * num\n    sieve[0] = sieve[1] = False\n\n    p = 2\n    while p * p < num:\n        if sieve[p]:\n            for multiple in range(p * p, num, p):\n                sieve[multiple] = False\n        p += 1\n\n    return sum(1 for is_prime in sieve if is_prime)"}
