{"task_id": "Mbpp/749", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List, Union\n\ndef sort_numeric_strings(lst: List[str]) -> List[Union[int, float]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Parses a list of numeric strings into numbers, sorts them numerically,\n    and normalizes integral floats to integers.\n    \"\"\"\n    parsed_numbers = []\n    for s in lst:\n        s_stripped = s.strip()\n        if '.' in s_stripped or 'e' in s_stripped.lower():\n            num = float(s_stripped)\n            if num.is_integer():\n                parsed_numbers.append(int(num))\n            else:\n                parsed_numbers.append(num)\n        else:\n            parsed_numbers.append(int(s_stripped))\n\n    parsed_numbers.sort()\n    return parsed_numbers\n```"}
